ABOUT DIALOG 9, 143, 347, 279
STYLE DS_MODALFRAME | WS_POPUP | WS_VISIBLE | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU
CAPTION "About RadWare"
FONT 8, "MS Sans Serif"
{
 DEFPUSHBUTTON "OK", 1, 155, 257, 50, 14
 LTEXT "  The RADWARE program is the front end control for use with a RADWARE Card. The card is a 450 KHz to 30 MHz HF Transceiver.", -1, 7, 6, 329, 16
 LTEXT "   Any comments you may have on this software may be left on the RADWARE BBS at (619) 744-4032. All comments will be appreciated. If you need more immediate help, you can call us at (619) 744-7266 or fax us at (619) 744 4745.", -1, 7, 26, 335, 30
 LTEXT "Version:   1.23", -1, 8, 62, 113, 8
 LTEXT "Compatible Sound Cards:", -1, 7, 75, 88, 8
 LTEXT "Echo Personal Sound System", -1, 21, 86, 113, 9
 LTEXT "*Cardinal Digital Sound Pro 16", -1, 18, 95, 107, 8
 LTEXT "Orchid SoundWave 32", -1, 21, 104, 104, 9
 LTEXT "&&*Wearnes Beethoven ADSP16", -1, 15, 113, 104, 8
 LTEXT "Western Digital Paradise 16-DSP", -1, 21, 122, 115, 8
 LTEXT "Adaptec AME-1570", -1, 21, 132, 106, 8
 LTEXT "  These sound cards all meet the PSA design requirements from Analog Devices. Although this should insure compatibility, the only sound cards tested so far are those marked with *. These cards are used in the RADWARE project because they contain the 2115 digital signal processor && the 1848 Codec. These chips can be reappropriated by the software to convert your sound card into the signal processing section of your receiver. The Wearnes board is the only board that we know of that will currently allow TRANSMIT capability. It is marked with &&. We currently believe that the Cardinal board is out of production.", -1, 136, 61, 207, 86
 LTEXT "PC Software:", -1, 56, 171, 49, 8
 LTEXT "ADSP2115 Software:", -1, 56, 181, 77, 8
 LTEXT "RF Engineer:", -1, 55, 191, 60, 8
 LTEXT "Alan Comer, KA6PPC", -1, 156, 171, 81, 8
 LTEXT "Alan Comer, KA6PPC", -1, 156, 181, 73, 8
 LTEXT "Brian Comer, KF6C (Former call: G3ZVC)", -1, 156, 191, 135, 8
 LTEXT "Design Team:", -1, 105, 155, 60, 8
 LTEXT "General Support:", -1, 55, 201, 60, 8
 LTEXT "Jean Comer (Former call: G8MOE)", -1, 156, 201, 127, 8
 LTEXT "Copyright (C) 1994,1995, by Comer Communications, Inc.", -1, 75, 216, 213, 10
 LTEXT "Permission is granted for use only with the Comer Communications, Inc. RADWARE card, or in simulation mode without controlling any form of receiver or transceiver. You may copy this software and give it to you friends as long as they comply with this statement.", -1, 15, 227, 321, 28
 PUSHBUTTON "Ordering Info", IDC_PUSHBUTTON2, 276, 258, 71, 22
}


